      "message": "[error] Line 831: 🔴 `requestIceRestart()` can deadlock: the callback acquires `callMutex_` and then calls `restartIceAfterRecovery()`, which acquires the same mutex again. This is a self-deadlock on the main thread under normal recovery flow. Drop the outer lock in the callback (or split into a `_Locked` variant) so the mutex is only taken once.",
